8 - Certified Endpoints
    -------------------

    The artifact boundary exports:

      certified_aporetic_fixed_point_contract
      certified_aporetic_excluded_middle_collapse_contract
      certified_aporetic_excluded_middle_obstruction_contract
      certified_aporetic_decision_collapse_contract
      certified_aporetic_decision_obstruction_contract
      certified_aporetic_equivalence_ad_absurdum_impossibility_contract
      certified_aporetic_decider_impossibility_contract
      certified_aporetic_lemma_contract
      aporetic_lemma_qed

    The terminal public witness is:

      aporetic_lemma_qed : WITNESS

    L001 deliberately has no OCaml extraction surface. Its executable
    substrate remains M001; L001 contributes certified obstruction endpoints
    and assumption reports.
